      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.52,
        "t": 661.86591953125,
        "r": 202.848,
        "b": 640.9352344167462
      },
      "content": "1. Remove the two M4 x10 hex Head Flange Bolts on the bottom of the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0198",
      "reading_order": 1236,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.152594757417,
        "t": 618.0427550644231,
        "r": 156.85591522698144,
        "b": 472.7869294883942
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0198.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0985",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0986"
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "id": "txt_0986",
      "reading_order": 1237,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 37.67999999999998,
        "t": 467.10601953125,
        "r": 149.343,
        "b": 420.48933441674615
      },
      "content": "4. Unfasten and remove the four M5 flange locking nuts & M5 hex head bolts from the door hinges"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0199",
      "reading_order": 1238,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 240.9441217754678,
        "t": 773.2693865161084,
        "r": 398.8400824735833,
        "b": 668.6750123538563
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0199.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0986",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0987"
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "id": "txt_0987",
      "reading_order": 1239,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 242.38499999999996,
        "t": 661.86591953125,
        "r": 385.84499999999997,
        "b": 628.3442344167462
      },
      "content": "2. Remove the three M3 x12 CSK Philips Head screws along the top edge of the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0200",
      "reading_order": 1240,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 197.68085451166638,
        "t": 605.6564704194877,
        "r": 349.8808783651995,
        "b": 482.72255338072637
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0200.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0987",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0988"
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "id": "txt_0988",
      "reading_order": 1241,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 210.35399999999998,
        "t": 466.26001953124995,
        "r": 342.537,
        "b": 432.4863344167461
      },
      "content": "5. Open the door and fit the locking pins in place to prevent the hinges snapping back."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0201",
      "reading_order": 1242,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 411.28996002190445,
        "t": 773.2290194983973,
        "r": 551.0358494110093,
        "b": 668.7019897827686
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0201.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0988",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0989"
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "id": "txt_0989",
      "reading_order": 1243,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 413.385,
        "t": 661.87491953125,
        "r": 533.562,
        "b": 640.9442344167462
      },
      "content": "3. Slide the door skin off the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0202",
      "reading_order": 1244,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 378.848383813126,
        "t": 621.3790654405898,
        "r": 537.1373082185555,
        "b": 474.4816732278109
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0202.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0989",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0990"
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "id": "txt_0990",
      "reading_order": 1245,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 384.4680000000001,
        "t": 465.7740195312499,
        "r": 509.451,
        "b": 444.8433344167461
      },
      "content": "6. Slide door off the hinges to remove."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0991",
      "reading_order": 1246,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 404.82601953125,
        "r": 543.303,
        "b": 371.3043344167462
      },
      "content": "The door choke is removed by unfastening the sixteen M8 hex nuts. On refitting the door choke, ensure the studs are positioned correctly in the centre of the hole and not resting on the shoulder of the stud. The nuts should be retightened diagonally in the following sequence to 2.1 Nm."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0203",
      "reading_order": 1247,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.28728795199882,
        "t": 367.9631328046287,
        "r": 192.82171446630466,
        "b": 244.709344894507
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0203.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0991",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0992"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0204",
      "reading_order": 1248,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 200.42369694120305,
        "t": 368.2945175023478,
        "r": 375.4030586793205,
        "b": 245.6876083822791
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0204.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0991",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0992"
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "id": "txt_0992",
      "reading_order": 1249,
      "section": "Removing the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 224.46601953125003,
        "r": 354.285,
        "b": 216.27873047605817
      },
      "content": "8. Wear gloves when removing or refitting insulation pads/mats in the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0993",
      "reading_order": 1250,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 192.40801953125003,
        "r": 192.36,
        "b": 181.62443937857824
      },
      "content": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0994",
      "reading_order": 1251,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 26.04,
        "t": 158.46601953125003,
        "r": 302.09700000000004,
        "b": 150.37833441674616
      },
      "content": "Follow the steps in the reverse order to refit the door to the oven."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0995",
      "reading_order": 1252,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.994000000000085,
        "t": 145.98301953124997,
        "r": 500.079,
        "b": 137.5353344167462
      },
      "content": " Holding the door squarely against the cavity, the hinge nuts and bolts should be torqued up to 3.5Nm."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0996",
      "reading_order": 1253,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.976,
        "t": 133.14001953125,
        "r": 448.22099999999995,
        "b": 124.69233441674623
      },
      "content": " Apply Loctite to the door skin bolts and screws, which should then be torqued up to 1Nm."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0997",
      "reading_order": 1254,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.95799999999997,
        "t": 120.54001953124998,
        "r": 534.729,
        "b": 99.13233441674618
      },
      "content": " Check that the door seal firmly meets the cavity frame all the way around once closed. A poor sealing door can cause issues with the oven's operation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0998",
      "reading_order": 1255,
      "section": "Refitting the door assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.949000000000126,
        "t": 94.86301953125007,
        "r": 358.68900000000014,
        "b": 86.41533441674619
      },
      "content": " Check the door switches are correctly adjusted and operating freely."
    }
  ]
}